    <!-- ═══════ 目标拆解 ═══════ -->
    <section class="view" id="view-goals">
<div class="section-intro">用来存放你长线的理想、阶段性目标和一步步拆解下来的行动。不必逼迫自己马上抵达终点，慢慢往前走就好。</div>
      <div class="page-head">
        <h1><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"></circle></svg>目标拆解</h1>
        <p>人生目标 · 里程碑进度可视化，勾选即更新进度条</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px">
        <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"></path><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path></svg>目标拆解三步法 · 把大目标变成今天能做的动作</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-2">
          <div>
            <h4>三步拆解（以"毕业前过法考"为例）</h4>
            <ol style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;padding-left:18px">
              <li><strong>定终点：</strong>把目标写成"可验证的结果"——法考客观题+主观题全部通过（大三9月考客观、10月考主观）</li>
              <li><strong>倒推里程碑：</strong>大二：民法刑法民诉先修+每天30分钟法条；大三上：客观题冲刺（刷题3000+）；大三下：主观题专项（案例分析+文书写作）</li>
              <li><strong>落到今天：</strong>今天就做"背3个刑法罪名构成要件+做10道真题"，做完勾掉，每天一个动作</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>让目标不半途而废的 5 个动作</h4>
            <ul style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.9">
              <li><strong>写下来并贴出来：</strong>贴在书桌前，每天看见一次</li>
              <li><strong>设进度条：</strong>下方每个目标卡都能勾里程碑，勾满=完成</li>
              <li><strong>每周复盘：</strong>周日晚花5分钟看进度，卡住就拆小一步</li>
              <li><strong>公开承诺：</strong>告诉一个会追问你的人</li>
              <li><strong>允许休息：</strong>断一天不亏，断一周才亏——明天继续就行</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="callout callout-info" style="margin-top:8px"><strong>怎么用本页：</strong>下方 7 个目标卡可自由改名/增删里程碑，勾选即更新进度条。把"三步法"套到你的目标上：先写终点，再倒推里程碑，最后落到"今天做什么"。</div>
      </div>      <div id="goalsContainer"><div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><span contenteditable="true" data-gt="0" onblur="editGoalTitle(0,this)" style="flex:1;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;cursor:text;outline:none">示例1：3 个月内读完 4 本书并输出读书笔记（可修改或删除）</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoal(0)">删除目标</button></div><p contenteditable="true" data-gd="0" onblur="editGoalDesc(0,this)" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0;cursor:text;outline:none">任何专业的成长都需要"持续输入+输出"。用这个目标训练"读完→写出来→形成自己的观点"的完整闭环。</p><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:8px 0"><div class="progress" style="flex:1"><div class="bar" style="width:0%"></div></div><span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--teal)">0%</span></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-reading&#39;,0)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="0-0" onblur="editGoalMs(0,0,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 1 周：选 4 本书（1 本专业+1 本认知+1 本历史+1 本文学），按难度排序</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(0,0)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-reading&#39;,1)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="0-1" onblur="editGoalMs(0,1,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 1 个月：读完第 1 本专业书，写 1 篇 1500 字读书笔记发到公众号/小红书</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(0,1)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-reading&#39;,2)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="0-2" onblur="editGoalMs(0,2,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 2 个月：读完第 2 本认知书，做 1 页思维导图，记住 3 个核心概念</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(0,2)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-reading&#39;,3)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="0-3" onblur="editGoalMs(0,3,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 3 个月：读完剩下 2 本（每月 1 本），各写 1 篇短评</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(0,3)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-reading&#39;,4)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="0-4" onblur="editGoalMs(0,4,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">复盘：把 4 篇笔记整理成合集，看看哪些观点改变了你的行动</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(0,4)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px"><input id="gmi_0" placeholder="添加里程碑..." style="flex:1"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="addGoalMs(0)">添加</button></div></div><div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><span contenteditable="true" data-gt="1" onblur="editGoalTitle(1,this)" style="flex:1;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;cursor:text;outline:none">示例2：90 天养成每周 3 次运动的习惯（可修改或删除）</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoal(1)">删除目标</button></div><p contenteditable="true" data-gd="1" onblur="editGoalDesc(1,this)" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0;cursor:text;outline:none">健康是所有目标的地基。这个目标训练"小到不可能失败"的习惯搭建：从 1 周 1 次开始，3 个月后自然变成每周 3 次。</p><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:8px 0"><div class="progress" style="flex:1"><div class="bar" style="width:0%"></div></div><span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--teal)">0%</span></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-health&#39;,0)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="1-0" onblur="editGoalMs(1,0,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 1 周：挑 1 项运动（跑步/跳绳/瑜伽/快走），每周 1 次，每次 20 分钟</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(1,0)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-health&#39;,1)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="1-1" onblur="editGoalMs(1,1,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 2 周：每周 2 次，时间加到 30 分钟</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(1,1)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-health&#39;,2)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="1-2" onblur="editGoalMs(1,2,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 3-4 周：每周 3 次，30-40 分钟，记录心率/时长/体感</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(1,2)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-health&#39;,3)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="1-3" onblur="editGoalMs(1,3,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 5-8 周：每周 3 次稳定，给自己设小奖励（完赛奖牌/新装备/泡澡）</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(1,3)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-health&#39;,4)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="1-4" onblur="editGoalMs(1,4,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 9-12 周：维持节奏，月底复盘体重/精神/睡眠的变化</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(1,4)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-health&#39;,5)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="1-5" onblur="editGoalMs(1,5,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">结业：把"运动 90 天"的截图发朋友圈，建立长期形象</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(1,5)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px"><input id="gmi_1" placeholder="添加里程碑..." style="flex:1"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="addGoalMs(1)">添加</button></div></div><div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><span contenteditable="true" data-gt="2" onblur="editGoalTitle(2,this)" style="flex:1;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;cursor:text;outline:none">示例3：6 个月内找到一份满意实习或副业（可修改或删除）</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoal(2)">删除目标</button></div><p contenteditable="true" data-gd="2" onblur="editGoalDesc(2,this)" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0;cursor:text;outline:none">求职/找副业不是"投简历+等结果"，而是"输出+连接+迭代"的系统动作。这套拆解可直接复用。</p><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:8px 0"><div class="progress" style="flex:1"><div class="bar" style="width:0%"></div></div><span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--teal)">0%</span></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-career&#39;,0)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="2-0" onblur="editGoalMs(2,0,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 1-2 周：定 3 个目标岗位/副业方向，分析招聘要求</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(2,0)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-career&#39;,1)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="2-1" onblur="editGoalMs(2,1,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 3-4 周：打磨简历+作品集，投 20 家，先拿面试经验</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(2,1)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-career&#39;,2)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="2-2" onblur="editGoalMs(2,2,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 5-6 周：复盘被拒原因，针对性补短板（技能/案例/表达）</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(2,2)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-career&#39;,3)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="2-3" onblur="editGoalMs(2,3,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 7-10 周：拿到 offer 后选最优；如果还无 offer，进模拟面试</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(2,3)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-career&#39;,4)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="2-4" onblur="editGoalMs(2,4,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 11-16 周：进入工作，前 2 周只观察+提问，之后才上手</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(2,4)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 0"><input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleGoal(&#39;demo-career&#39;,5)" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0"><span contenteditable="true" data-gm="2-5" onblur="editGoalMs(2,5,this)" style="flex:1;font-size:13px;cursor:text;outline:none">第 18-24 周：积累 1-2 个可写进简历的成果，准备下一份</span><button class="btn btn-sm" style="font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--hint)" onclick="delGoalMs(2,5)">×</button></div><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px"><input id="gmi_2" placeholder="添加里程碑..." style="flex:1"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="addGoalMs(2)">添加</button></div></div><div style="height:16px"></div><div class="card" style="border:1px dashed var(--border)"><h3 style="margin-bottom:10px">＋ 添加新目标</h3><input id="newGoalTitle" placeholder="目标名称，如：考取职业资格证" style="width:100%;margin-bottom:6px"><input id="newGoalDesc" placeholder="目标描述（选填）" style="width:100%;margin-bottom:6px"><input id="newGoalMs" placeholder="首个里程碑（选填）" style="width:100%;margin-bottom:6px"><textarea id="newGoalSteps" placeholder="目标拆解步骤（选填）：每行写一条，添加后自动变成可勾选的里程碑。
例如：
第1周：完成调研
第2周：完成初稿
第3周：修改定稿" style="min-height:90px;margin-bottom:6px"></textarea><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="addGoal()">添加目标</button><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--hint)">也可只填名称先创建，之后随时逐条补充里程碑</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

