            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path></svg></div>
            <div class="info"><div class="name">历史 · 文明</div><div class="desc">故宫·数字多宝阁，3D 看文物背后的文明脉络，历史原来这么近</div></div><div class="arrow">↗</div>
