            <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-4.96.44 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 1-.34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.98-3A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 9.5 2Z"></path></svg></div>
            <div class="info"><div class="name">人文 · 思想</div><div class="desc">TED 经典演讲：全球顶尖大脑的 18 分钟，最划算的认知输入</div></div><div class="arrow">↗</div>
          </a>
          <a class="res-link" href="https://www.namoc.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
